abstract: >-
  An academic research project of Synthetic Realities, led by Dr Sam Martin, Smart Data
  Research UK (UKRI) Fellow (Grant number UKRI4010), Manchester Metropolitan University (MMU).
  A cozy island game that teaches the SDA Vision community workshop method (Notice, Discuss,
  Check, Reflect) for working out how a picture was made before sharing it.
